# Dockerfile build context hygiene.
# Anything listed here will NOT be copied into the image. The goal is to keep
# the image small and the build fast.

# Node / Next build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/out
**/dist

# VCS
.git
.gitignore
**/.github

# Env files — never ship real secrets into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.selfhosted.example

# Editor / OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log

# Docs / meta (read from repo on host, not from inside the image)
**/*.md
!**/README.md
**/LICENSE
docs
**/.fuse_hidden*

# Tests / tooling artifacts
**/.vitest
**/.playwright
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
